<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teltrend cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teltrend cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said analyst Greg Mesniaeff reduced the rating on Teltrend Inc to short-term market perform from buy, and kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- cut earnings estimates in a two-stage move from $2.12 per share for the 1997 year, ending in July. The first cut was to $2.07 Tuesday afternoon, and the second reduction was to $1.56 per share Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>-- lowered the 1998 estimate to $1.88 from $2.72 for the year.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 5-3/8 to 17-5/8.</p>
</text>
